{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/389192-hunter-census-question-new-york-city","id":389192,"title":"Hunter census question - New York City","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-01T18:12:26-08:00","id":389192,"title":"Hunter census question - New York City","content":"There eight million+ people living in New York City, and several million are Catholic, and about 1,300 ordained clergy in the Archdiocese, with about 900 more secular priests. Combined with the fact that at least one branch of Mallus Maleficarium isn't too strict about who they recruit and that city of that size invites a fairly large supernatural population. Just from your gut instinct, how many Hunters does the Mallus Maleficarium have in the region? And how many do the other compacts and conspiracies?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T18:55:16-08:00","id":389233,"title":"","content":"Probably something around 20? Obviously you want to do as many as necessary for your story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T02:07:38-08:00","id":391166,"title":"","content":"Also remember that when you are talking about the top tier hunter organizations it is not just a matter of population. Those hunters are directed by an organized world spanning organization who will direct hunters from one area to another if problems prop up. In my WoD I would likely only have a handful of permanent agents in a city like New-York, mostly observers, although in New-York a permanent cell of active hunters also makes sense. These observers are likely to use lower tier hunters most of the time, only calling upon their bosses when a big problem reveals itself. For me, one of the biggest reasons to use these groups for my PCs (as opposed to an enemy) is to actually make it a global campaign <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4560-madfox11","name":"Madfox11","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}